For M block

$$\begin{aligned}
& 10 \mathrm{~g} \sin 53^{\circ}-\mu(10 \mathrm{~g}) \cos 53^{\circ}-\mathrm{T}=10 \times 2 \\
& \mathrm{~T}=80-15-20 \\
& \mathrm{~T}=45 \mathrm{~N}
\end{aligned}$$

For $$\mathrm{m}$$ block

$$\begin{aligned}
& \mathrm{T}-\mathrm{mg} \sin 37^{\circ}-\mu \mathrm{mg} \cos 37^{\circ}=\mathrm{m} \times 2 \\
& 45=10 \mathrm{~m} \\
& \mathrm{~m}=4.5 \mathrm{~kg}
\end{aligned}$$

$$\begin{aligned}
